# CI/test episode fixtures — written to disk by test setup, unlinked by test
# teardown (e.g. test-chat-episode-hook-e2e.ts's docs/episode-9993.md). Never
# meant to be tracked; ignoring them stops a mid-test-run commit from sweeping
# one in. Reserved range matches RESERVED_FIXTURE_EPISODE_MIN in
# server/services/episode-content-loss-guard.ts — keep both in sync.
docs/episode-99[0-9][0-9].md
docs/episode-9[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].md
